
ChronosMeadow_Text_Celebi::
	.string "Bi…bi!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_BrendanNoWay::
	.string "BRENDAN: No way you got to\nCELEBI first!\pYou'll have to battle me for it!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_BrendanBattleChallenge::
	.string "You'll have to battle me for it!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_BrendanDefeat::
	.string "No way!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_BrendanPostBattle::
	.string "Wow.\nYou proved yourself.\pI guess you must be worthy to\ncatch the legendary POKéMON.\pI'll see you around.$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_HealerOffer::
	.string "This is a lovely meadow.\pWould you like me to heal\lyour POKéMON?$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_HealerAccept::
	.string "Okay! Let me heal them for you!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_HealerHealed::
	.string "Your POKéMON are fully healed!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_HealerDecline::
	.string "Okay! Feel free to ask if you\nchange your mind!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_KajIntro::
	.string "I came here looking for legendary\nPOKéMON! Are you also a seeker?$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_KajDefeat::
	.string "You're strong!\nA true trainer!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_KajPostBattle::
	.string "Legends say this island appears only\nto worthy trainers.$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_JasonIntro::
	.string "CHRONOS ISLE is home to a legendary\nPOKéMON, I'm certain of it!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_JasonDefeat::
	.string "Impressive!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_JasonPostBattle::
	.string "The legend must be real if you\nmade it this far.$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_KendraIntro::
	.string "I heard rumors of a time-traveling\nPOKéMON on this island!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_KendraDefeat::
	.string "You're incredible!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_KendraPostBattle::
	.string "Maybe the legendary POKéMON is\nwatching us right now…$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_KariIntro::
	.string "This meadow has an ancient energy!\nDo you feel it too?$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_KariDefeat::
	.string "You really are special!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_KariPostBattle::
	.string "I sense something powerful deeper\nin this meadow…$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_JackIntro::
	.string "I've been flying over the island\nlooking for the legendary POKéMON!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_JackDefeat::
	.string "You grounded me!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_JackPostBattle::
	.string "From the sky, I saw something\nglowing in this meadow!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_AndrewIntro::
	.string "My POKéMON and I scour the skies\nfor rare creatures!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_AndrewDefeat::
	.string "Shot down!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_AndrewPostBattle::
	.string "There's definitely something special\nabout this island.$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_ChuckIntro::
	.string "You got a problem? My POKéMON and\nI don't like punks!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_ChuckDefeat::
	.string "Tch! You're tougher than you look!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_ChuckPostBattle::
	.string "Alright, I respect strength.\nYou earned your spot here.$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_NickIntro::
	.string "My birds spotted this island from\nthe sky! Let's battle!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_NickDefeat::
	.string "Brought down to earth!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_NickPostBattle::
	.string "Legends speak of a POKéMON that\ncan heal forests…$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_RodneyIntro::
	.string "I climbed CHRONOS ISLE looking\nfor treasure and legends!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_RodneyDefeat::
	.string "You're a tough one!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_RodneyPostBattle::
	.string "This meadow's beauty is unlike\nanything in KANTO!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_DeLeonIntro::
	.string "Exploring this island is my greatest\nadventure yet!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_DeLeonDefeat::
	.string "What a challenge!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_DeLeonPostBattle::
	.string "I heard CELEBI appears before those\nwith pure hearts.$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_AndyIntro::
	.string "I've traveled far and wide, but\nthis island is something else!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_AndyDefeat::
	.string "You're one tough trainer!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_AndyPostBattle::
	.string "The energy here reminds me of\nancient ruins…$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_MarcusIntro::
	.string "CHRONOS ISLE's mysteries are waiting\nto be uncovered!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_MarcusDefeat::
	.string "You solved the mystery of my defeat!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_MarcusPostBattle::
	.string "They say legendary POKéMON only\nappear to chosen trainers.$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_GuyIntro::
	.string "My psychic powers sense a powerful\naura in this meadow!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_GuyDefeat::
	.string "Your aura is stronger!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_GuyPostBattle::
	.string "I can sense CELEBI's presence…\nIt's watching us!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_TreIntro::
	.string "I had a vision of this island and\na legendary POKéMON!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_TreDefeat::
	.string "My vision didn't show this loss!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_TrePostBattle::
	.string "CELEBI is the voice of the forest…\nCan you hear it?$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_SethIntro::
	.string "The psychic energy here is\nincredible! Can you feel it?$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_SethDefeat::
	.string "Your spirit is powerful!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_SethPostBattle::
	.string "I sense CELEBI traveled through time\nto bring us here…$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_BrookeIntro::
	.string "Hehehehe… The spirits guided me\nto this mystical place…$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_BrookeDefeat::
	.string "The spirits have spoken!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_BrookePostBattle::
	.string "CELEBI's power transcends life\nand death… How fascinating!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_OzIntro::
	.string "Greetings! I've traveled from afar\nto witness this legendary place.\pShall we have a proper battle?$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_OzDefeat::
	.string "Splendid! A fine match indeed!$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_OzPostBattle::
	.string "CHRONOS ISLE is truly a gentleman's\nparadise.\pThe air itself seems touched by\nCELEBI's grace.$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_Tourist::
	.string "I came all the way from JOHTO to\nsee this legendary place!\pThe flowers here bloom in colors\nI've never seen before.\pIt's like time itself flows\ndifferently in this meadow…$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_Researcher::
	.string "Fascinating! The plant life here\nshows no signs of decay.\pSome of these flowers appear to be\ngrowing backwards in time!\pCould CELEBI's presence be affecting\nthe very fabric of nature?$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_OldWoman::
	.string "I visited CHRONOS ISLE 50 years\nago as a young girl…\pThis meadow looks exactly the same\nas it did back then.\pNot a single flower has withered.\nIt's truly a miracle…$"

ChronosMeadow_Text_Sign::
	.string "CHRONOS MEADOW\nWhere time stands still$"


